:: Deadwood Pirate Raid Widgets [widget]

<<widget 'deadwood-pirate-raid-pool'>>
  <<if !maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations') or !$MoreTransformations?.harbour?.raid or $passage isnot 'Pirate Deck' or $location isnot 'pirate_ship' or $combat or $replayScene or $statFreeze or $frozenValues or $possessed or $eventforced or $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>><<exit>><</if>>
  <<if $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.stage and Math.floor(Time.days) - $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.day gte 3>>
    <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.stage to '', $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.outcome to '', $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.needsEffects to false>>
  <</if>>
  <<if Weather.dayState is 'night' and !$MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.stage and Math.floor(Time.days) - $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.day gte 3 and $stress lt $stressmax and $eventskip is 0 and ($pirate_journey is undefined or $pirate_journey gt 1)>>
    <<addinlineevent 'deadwood_pirate_raid' `Weather.bloodMoon ? 1.5 : 0.5`>>
      <<deadwood-pirate-raid-intro>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-pirate-raid-intro'>>
  <<set _shipRaid to $MoreTransformations?.harbour?.raid>>
  <<if !_shipRaid or !maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations') or $location isnot 'pirate_ship' or $combat or $replayScene or $statFreeze or $frozenValues or $possessed or $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>><<exit>><</if>>
  <<if !_shipRaid.stage>>
    <<dread 250>><<sanity -30>>
    <<set _shipRaid.day to Math.floor(Time.days), _shipRaid.stage to 'choice', _shipRaid.outcome to '', _shipRaid.approach to Weather.bloodMoon ? 'blood' : either('bell', 'dark'), _shipRaid.talked to false, _shipRaid.rested to false, _shipRaid.needsEffects to false, _shipRaid.encounters += 1>>
  <</if>>
  <<if _shipRaid.stage isnot 'choice'>><<exit>><</if>>
  <<if Weather.dayState isnot 'night'>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Morning light spreads across the deck. The crew cut the last trailing ropes. There is no sign of the other ship.' '晨光洒上甲板。船员们砍断最后几根绳索，那艘船已经不见了。'>><br><br>
    <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the deck', '返回甲板'] 'Pirate Deck'>>
      <<if $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.stage is 'choice' and !$combat and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$frozenValues and !$possessed and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
        <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.stage to '', $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.outcome to '', $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.needsEffects to false, $eventskip to 1>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br><<exit>>
  <</if>>
  <<switch _shipRaid.approach>>
    <<case 'dark'>>
      <<lanSwitch 'A wet rope strikes the hull. You lean over the rail. An unlit ship is drawing alongside, its barnacled hull scraping yours. A hook catches the wood beside your hand.' '一根湿绳拍在船身上。你探头望向船边，一艘没有航灯的船正靠过来，结满藤壶的船身擦过你们的船。一只铁钩扣住你手边的栏杆。'>>
    <<case 'blood'>>
      <<lanSwitch 'The blood moon stains the waves red. Torn sails appear through the fog. A ship grinds alongside, barnacles scraping the hull. Hooks catch the rail, and the ropes pull tight.' '血月将浪头染成暗红。雾里露出几张破帆，一艘船擦着你们的船身靠了过来，藤壶刮得木头吱吱作响。铁钩扣上栏杆，绳子绷紧了。'>>
    <<default>>
      <<lanSwitch "A ship's bell sounds through the fog. You see no lights, but a ship is already close enough to smell the rotten wood. A hook lands beside your hand. The rope snaps taut." '雾里传来一声船钟。你看不见航灯，却已经闻到腐木的气味。一只铁钩砸在你手边，连着的绳索猛地绷紧。'>>
  <</switch>><br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Pale fingers grip the rail. A sailor brings a belaying pin down on them. Bone cracks, but the hand holds fast. Another figure climbs aboard, dripping seawater onto the deck.
      <br><br>
      <<if _shipRaid.encounters gt 1>>"Back again?" Zephyr shouts. "Cut the ropes! Keep them off me cargo!"
      <<else>>"Boarders!" Zephyr draws a pistol. "Guard the hatch! Don't let those drowned thieves near me cargo!"<</if>>
      The crew rush forward with cutlasses and belaying pins. A wave slams the hulls together. A sailor loses their footing and falls between the ships. You hear splashing below.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      苍白的手指扣住船舷。一名水手用插销棒砸了下去，骨头咔嚓一响，那只手却还抓着木头。另一个人翻上甲板，衣服往下淌着海水。
      <br><br>
      <<if _shipRaid.encounters gt 1>>“又来了？”泽菲尔喊道。“给老子砍断绳子！别让他们碰货！”
      <<else>>“有人登船！”泽菲尔拔出手枪。“守住舱口！别让那帮淹死的贼搬走老子的货！”<</if>>
      船员们拿着水手刀和插销棒冲上前。一个浪头将两艘船撞在一起，一名水手脚下不稳，跌进两船之间。下面传来挣扎的水声。
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<if _shipRaid.encounters gt 1>>
    <<lanSwitch 'You remember how those dead hands refused to let go. The crew bring a spar to prise them off the rail.' '你记得那些死人手怎么砸都不肯松开。船员们抬来一根长杆，要把它们撬下去。'>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if _shipRaid.approach is 'blood'>>
    <<lanSwitch 'One boarder is much larger than the others. It hauls itself aboard with one hand, weed trailing from its clothes. The railing bends under its weight.' '其中一个登船者比其他人高大得多。它单手撑上船舷，衣服上拖着海草，栏杆被它压得弯了下去。'>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations')?.Undead.active>>
    <<lanSwitch 'The boarder pauses when its eyes meet yours, as though it recognises something. Then it pulls itself closer, fingers tightening around the rail.' '登船者与你对上视线时停了一下，仿佛认出了什么。随后它又往上爬，手指更紧地扣住栏杆。'>><br><br>
  <<elseif $angel gte 3 or $fallenangel gte 1>>
    <<lanSwitch 'A familiar light stirs beneath your skin. The corpse hisses and leans away, but its fingers stay hooked over the rail.' '熟悉的光芒在你皮肤下流动。尸体嘶叫着向后躲，手指却还扣在栏杆上。'>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if $pirate_rank gte 1>>
    <<if _shipRaid.encounters gt 1>>
      <<lanSwitch 'A crewmate thrusts a coil of rope into your hands. "Ye know what to do, mate. Watch those hooks!"' '一个船员将绳子塞进你手里。“知道该怎么干吧，伙计。小心铁钩！”'>>
    <<else>>
      <<lanSwitch 'A crewmate holds out a rope. "Help at the rail, mate! Keep them off the deck!"' '一个船员递来绳子。“去船边帮忙，伙计！别让他们上来！”'>>
    <</if>><br><br>
  <<else>>
    <<lanSwitch 'A sailor shoves past you. "Get below if ye can\'t fight, scum!" The way to the hatch is still clear.' '一个水手推开你。“不会打就滚到底舱去，奴工！”通往舱口的路还没有被堵住。'>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<icon 'alert.png'>><<lanLink ['Hold off the boarder', '挡住登船者'] 'Deadwood Pirate Raid Fight'>>
    <<if $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.stage is 'choice' and !$combat and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$frozenValues and !$possessed and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
      <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.stage to 'fight_pending'>>
    <</if>>
  <</lanLink>><br>
  <<if maplebirch.get('Psyche')?.active>>
    <<icon 'coldmoon-harbour/ghost-ship.png'>><<lanLink ['Go closer to the other ship', '走近另一艘船'] 'Deadwood Pirate Raid Fight'>>
      <<if $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.stage is 'choice' and maplebirch.get('Psyche')?.active and !$combat and !$possessed and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
        <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.stage to 'fight_pending', $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.outcome to 'contact'>>
        <<fascination 200>><<sanity -30>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><<lsanity>><<ggfascination>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if !pcAreArmsBound('any')>>
    <<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 400>>
    <<icon 'coldmoon-harbour/cut-boarding-ropes.png'>><<lanLink ['Cut the boarding ropes (0:03)', '斩断登船绳 (0:03)'] 'Deadwood Pirate Raid Finish'>>
      <<set _shipRaid to $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid>>
      <<if _shipRaid.stage is 'choice' and !$combat and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$frozenValues and !$possessed and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
        <<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 400>><<skulduggerycheck 'silent'>>
        <<set _shipRaid.outcome to $skulduggerysuccess is 1 and currentSkillValue('physique') gte random(Math.ceil($physiquemax * 0.15), Math.ceil($physiquemax * 0.45)) ? 'ropes' : 'ropes_failed', _shipRaid.stage to 'resolved', _shipRaid.needsEffects to true>>
        <<skulduggeryuse>><<physique 1 'noMessage'>><<tiredness 5>>
        <<if _shipRaid.outcome is 'ropes'>>
          <<set _shipRaid.victories += 1>><<pirate_status 2>><<npcincr Zephyr love 1>><<sanity 10>><<psyche-rest 0 150>>
        <<else>>
          <<pain 4>><<stress 4>>
        <</if>>
        <<pass 3>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><<physiquedifficulty `Math.ceil($physiquemax * 0.15)` `Math.ceil($physiquemax * 0.45)`>><<gtiredness>><br>
  <<else>>
    <span class='purple'><<lanSwitch 'You cannot cut the ropes with your arms bound.' '手臂被缚，你无法斩断绳索。'>></span><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if !pcAreArmsBound('any') and $leftleg isnot 'bound' and $rightleg isnot 'bound'>>
    <<swimicon>><<lanLink ['Rescue the sailor (0:05)', '救起落水的船员 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Pirate Raid Finish'>>
      <<set _shipRaid to $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid>>
      <<if _shipRaid.stage is 'choice' and !$combat and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$frozenValues and !$possessed and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
        <<set _shipRaid.outcome to currentSkillValue('swimmingskill') gte random(200, 600) and currentSkillValue('physique') gte random(Math.ceil($physiquemax * 0.1), Math.ceil($physiquemax * 0.35)) ? 'rescue' : 'rescue_failed', _shipRaid.stage to 'resolved', _shipRaid.needsEffects to true>>
        <<swimmingskilluse>><<physique 1 'noMessage'>><<tiredness 10>><<water>>
        <<if _shipRaid.outcome is 'rescue'>>
          <<set _shipRaid.rescues += 1>><<pirate_status 3>><<npcincr Zephyr love 1>><<sanity 10>><<psyche-rest 0 150>>
        <<else>>
          <<pain 4>><<stress 6>>
        <</if>>
        <<pass 5>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><<swimmingdifficulty 200 600>><<physiquedifficulty `Math.ceil($physiquemax * 0.1)` `Math.ceil($physiquemax * 0.35)`>><<gtiredness>><br>
  <<else>>
    <span class='purple'><<lanSwitch 'You cannot swim to the sailor while bound.' '身上的束缚让你无法下水救人。'>></span><br>
  <</if>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Take cover below deck (0:05)', '躲回船舱 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Pirate Raid Finish'>>
    <<if $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.stage is 'choice' and !$combat and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$frozenValues and !$possessed and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
      <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.outcome to 'shelter', $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.stage to 'resolved', $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.needsEffects to true>>
      <<stress 3>><<pass 5>>
    <</if>>
  <</lanLink>><<gstress>><br>
<</widget>>

<!-- 仅由战斗的结束链接调用。先保存结果，原版 endcombat 自行清理事件。 -->
<<widget 'deadwood-pirate-raid-end'>>
  <<set _shipRaid to $MoreTransformations?.harbour?.raid>>
  <<if _shipRaid?.stage is 'fight' and $combat is 1 and $NPCList[0]?.per is 'deadwood_ship_undead' and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$frozenValues and !$possessed and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck and (Weather.dayState isnot 'night' or $enemyhealth lte 0 or maplebirch.combat.climax or ($alarm is 1 and $rescue gte 1) or $finish is 1 or ($pain gte 100 and $willpowerpain is 0))>>
    <<set _shipRaid.outcome to $enemyhealth lte 0 ? 'fight_won' : Weather.dayState isnot 'night' ? 'dawn' : $pain gte 100 and $willpowerpain is 0 and !maplebirch.combat.climax and !($alarm is 1 and $rescue gte 1) and $finish isnot 1 ? 'fight_lost' : 'escaped', _shipRaid.stage to 'resolved', _shipRaid.needsEffects to true>>
    <<if _shipRaid.outcome is 'fight_won'>>
      <<set _shipRaid.victories += 1>><<pirate_status 3>><<npcincr Zephyr love 1>><<sanity 10>><<psyche-rest 0 150>>
    <<elseif _shipRaid.outcome is 'escaped'>>
      <<psyche-rest 0 100>>
    <</if>>
    <<if maplebirch.combat.climax>><<ejaculation 'short'>><</if>>
    <<clotheson>><<endcombat>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-pirate-raid-journal'>>
  <<set _shipRaid to $MoreTransformations?.harbour?.raid>>
  <<if ['choice', 'fight_pending', 'fight', 'resolved'].includes(_shipRaid?.stage)>>
    <div class='bold'><<lanSwitch 'Boarders in the fog' '雾中的登船者'>></div>
    <ul class='journal'><li>
      <<if $location is 'pirate_ship' and !(_shipRaid.stage is 'fight' and !($combat is 1 and $NPCList[0]?.per is 'deadwood_ship_undead'))>>
        <<if _shipRaid.stage is 'resolved'>>
          <<lanSwitch 'The dead boarders have been driven off. The sailors are clearing the deck.' '登船的亡灵已被击退，水手们正在清理甲板。'>>
        <<else>>
          <<lanSwitch "A ghost ship drew alongside Zephyr's vessel. The crew are fighting off the boarders. You have not seen how it ends." '一艘鬼船靠近了泽菲尔的船，船员们正在抵抗登船者。你还不知道这场袭击会如何结束。'>>
        <</if>>
        <br><<lanSwitch 'You can look for the crew when you return to the deck.' '回到甲板后，可以去船员那边看看。'>>
      <<else>>
        <<lanSwitch 'You left before the raid was over. You did not see how the crew drove the boarders off.' '袭击结束前你就离开了，没有看到船员们如何击退登船者。'>>
      <</if>>
    </li></ul><hr>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-pirate-raid-link'>>
  <<if !maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations') or !['choice', 'fight_pending', 'fight', 'resolved'].includes($MoreTransformations?.harbour?.raid?.stage)
      or $passage isnot 'Pirate Deck' or $location isnot 'pirate_ship' or $combat or $replayScene or $statFreeze or $frozenValues
      or $possessed or $eventforced or $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck or $stress gte $stressmax>><<exit>><</if>>
  <!-- 船舱导航只出现在原版普通菜单中，到港和强制事件先处理完才恢复袭击。 -->
  <<set $_raidDeckMenu to Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('#passage-content [data-passage]')).some(link => link.dataset.passage is 'Pirate Cabin')>>
  <<if $_raidDeckMenu>>
    <<icon 'coldmoon-harbour/ghost-ship.png'>><<lanLink ['See how the crew are doing', '去船员那边看看'] 'Deadwood Pirate Raid'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Pirate Raid
<<set _shipRaid to $MoreTransformations?.harbour?.raid>>
<<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Deadwood Pirate Raid'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if $location is 'pirate_ship' and _shipRaid?.stage is 'choice' and !$combat>>
  <<set $outside to 1>><<effects>>
  <<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
    <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Deadwood Pirate Raid'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
  <<else>>
    <<deadwood-pirate-raid-intro>>
  <</if>>
<<elseif $location is 'pirate_ship' and ((_shipRaid?.stage is 'fight_pending' and !$combat) or (_shipRaid?.stage is 'fight' and $combat is 1 and $NPCList[0]?.per is 'deadwood_ship_undead'))>>
  <<include 'Deadwood Pirate Raid Fight'>>
<<elseif $location is 'pirate_ship' and _shipRaid?.stage is 'resolved' and !$combat>>
  <<include 'Deadwood Pirate Raid Finish'>>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'There are no boarders here. You did not see how the raid ended.' '这里已经没有登船者了，你没能看到袭击如何结束。'>><br><br>
  <<if $location is 'pirate_ship' and !$combat>>
    <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the deck', '返回甲板'] 'Pirate Deck'>>
      <<if $MoreTransformations?.harbour?.raid and !$combat and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$frozenValues and !$possessed and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
        <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.stage to '', $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.outcome to '', $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.needsEffects to false, $eventskip to 1>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <<else>>
    <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Open your journal', '打开日志']>><<overlayReplace 'journal'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Pirate Raid Fight [DefaultCombat]
<<set _shipRaid to $MoreTransformations?.harbour?.raid>>
<<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Deadwood Pirate Raid Fight'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if $location isnot 'pirate_ship' or !['fight_pending', 'fight'].includes(_shipRaid?.stage) or ($combat and $NPCList[0]?.per isnot 'deadwood_ship_undead')>>
  <<include 'Deadwood Pirate Raid'>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if _shipRaid.stage is 'fight_pending' and ($replayScene or $statFreeze or $frozenValues or $possessed)>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the deck', '返回甲板'] 'Pirate Deck'>><</lanLink>><br><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<set $outside to 1>>
<<if _shipRaid.stage is 'fight_pending' and !$combat and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$frozenValues and !$possessed>>
  <<if _shipRaid.outcome is 'contact'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You lean over the broken rail. A jawless corpse paces the other deck. <span @class="'purple ' + basicHypnoCss()">Through the waves and shouting, a raspy voice gives a clear order to work the capstan. You hold your breath, trying to make out the next command.</span> Cold fingers suddenly close around your forearm. You brace your feet against the deck as the corpse uses your arm to haul itself over the rail.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你扶着断裂的栏杆，探头望向对面的甲板。一具下颌脱落的尸体正在来回踱步。<span @class="'purple ' + basicHypnoCss()">浪声与喊叫声里，一道沙哑的声音清清楚楚地命人推起绞盘。你不由得屏息，想听清下一句号令。</span>冰冷的手指突然扣住你的小臂。你用脚抵住甲板，尸体正借着你的手臂翻过船舷。
    <</language>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<endevent>><<generateNPC 1 'a'>>
  <<set $finish to 0, $consensual to 0, $NPCList[0].per to 'deadwood_ship_undead', $NPCList[0].skincolour to 'ghost', $NPCList[0].monster to 'monster', $NPCList[0].health to _shipRaid.approach is 'blood' ? 360 : 300, $NPCList[0].healthmax to $NPCList[0].health, $NPCList[0].role to lanSwitch('undead pirate', '亡灵海盗'), $NPCList[0].fullDescription to lanSwitch('undead pirate', '亡灵海盗')>>
  <<npcClothesType $NPCList[0] 'docker2'>>
  <<person1>><<neutral 1>><<maninit>><<npcidlegenitals>>
  <<set $enemytrust to -30, $enemyanger to 40, $enemystrength to _shipRaid.approach is 'blood' ? 20000 : 18000, _shipRaid.stage to 'fight'>>
  <<lanSwitch 'The dead pirate reaches for you, water streaming from its sleeves. You knock its hands aside and brace yourself on the swaying deck.' '亡灵海盗伸手抓向你，袖口不断淌着海水。你架开它的手，在摇晃的甲板上站稳。'>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<if _shipRaid.stage is 'fight' and $combat is 1 and $NPCList[0]?.per is 'deadwood_ship_undead'>>
  <<effects>>
  <<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
    <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Deadwood Pirate Raid Fight'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>><<exit>>
  <</if>>
  <<if Weather.dayState is 'night'>>
    <<effectsman>><<alarmstate>><<man>><<stateman>><br><br><<actionsman>>
  <</if>>
  <<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
    <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Deadwood Pirate Raid Fight'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
  <<elseif _combatend or Weather.dayState isnot 'night' or $enemyhealth lte 0 or maplebirch.combat.climax or ($alarm is 1 and $rescue gte 1) or $finish is 1 or ($pain gte 100 and $willpowerpain is 0)>>
    <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Deadwood Pirate Raid Finish'>><<deadwood-pirate-raid-end>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
  <<else>>
    <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Deadwood Pirate Raid Fight'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
  <</if>>
<<else>>
  <<include 'Deadwood Pirate Raid'>>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Pirate Raid Finish
<<set _shipRaid to $MoreTransformations?.harbour?.raid>>
<<if _shipRaid?.stage is 'resolved' and _shipRaid.outcome is 'fight_lost' and !$combat and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$frozenValues and !$possessed and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
  <<goto 'Deadwood Ghost Ship Capture'>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Deadwood Pirate Raid Finish'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if $location isnot 'pirate_ship' or _shipRaid?.stage isnot 'resolved' or $combat>>
  <<include 'Deadwood Pirate Raid'>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if _shipRaid.needsEffects and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$frozenValues and !$possessed>>
  <<set _shipRaid.needsEffects to false>><<effects>>
  <<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
    <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Deadwood Pirate Raid Finish'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>><<exit>>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<<if !_shipRaid.talked and !_shipRaid.rested>>
<<switch _shipRaid.outcome>>
  <<case 'fight_won'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You drive the corpse back against the rail. Two sailors catch it with a spar and tip it overboard. It hits the water, but a hand immediately catches one of the trailing ropes.
        <br><br>
        "Cut every last rope!" Zephyr shouts at the top of <<his 'Zephyr'>> lungs. An axe severs the final line, and the other ship falls back into the fog. The captain checks the cargo hatch, then grins at you. "Good work. Ye've got some fight in ye."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你将尸体逼退到栏杆旁。两个水手抬起长杆，合力将它掀下船舷。水花刚溅起来，一只手又攀住了拖在海里的绳子。
        <br><br>
        “把绳子全砍断！”泽菲尔喊道。短斧砍断最后一根缆绳，那艘船退入海雾。船长检查过货舱的锁，才转头朝你笑了笑。“干得漂亮，有两下子。”
    <</language>><<ggrespect>><<glove 'Zephyr'>>
  <<case 'ropes'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You take an axe from beside the hatch and run along the rail, dodging hooks as you cut the ropes. The last line parts and whips past your shoulder. The ships pull apart. A pirate clinging to the hull loses its grip and falls between them.
        <br><br>
        Wind fills the mainsail. The crew knock the remaining hands off the rail with spars and belaying pins. "That's it! Keep her moving!" Zephyr shouts. The captain nods to you, then turns towards the helm.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你抓起舱口旁的短斧，避开铁钩，沿着船舷砍断绳索。最后一根缆绳从你肩旁弹过，两艘船拉开了距离。一个攀在船边的海盗抓了个空，跌进下面的海水中。
        <br><br>
        海风鼓满主帆。船员们用长杆和插销棒打落剩下的手。“就这样！继续开！”泽菲尔喊道。船长朝你点点头，转身走向舵轮。
    <</language>><<ggrespect>><<glove 'Zephyr'>>
  <<case 'ropes_failed'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You take the axe, but a wave pulls the hooked rope tight before you can strike. The wet handle slips from your hand. You fall against the rail, striking your shoulder.
        <br><br>
        A sailor swears and takes the axe while another pulls you clear. By the time you get to your feet, the crew have driven the last boarder over the side. The other ship drifts back into the fog.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你拿起短斧，还没挥下去，一个浪头便扯紧了绳索。湿滑的斧柄从手中滑脱，你撞上栏杆，肩头一阵发麻。
        <br><br>
        一名水手骂了一声，接过斧头，另一人将你拉到旁边。等你站稳，船员们已经把最后一个登船者赶下船。那艘船退回了雾里。
    <</language>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
  <<case 'rescue'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You tie a rope around your waist and climb over the rail. The sailor is struggling between the hulls. You catch their collar and lift their head above the water. They cough and grab the rope.
        <br><br>
        The crew haul you both aboard. The sailor coughs up seawater, still clutching your sleeve. Behind you, the last rope parts. "Get yer breath back, then back to work!" Zephyr orders. Someone throws a blanket over your shoulders.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你将绳子系在腰间，翻过船舷。落水的水手正在两船之间挣扎。你抓住衣领，将对方的头托出水面。水手呛咳着抓住了绳子。
        <br><br>
        船员们将你们一起拉上甲板。获救的水手咳出海水，还紧紧抓着你的袖子。身后最后一根缆绳断了。“喘够了就回去干活！”泽菲尔喊道。一条毯子搭上了你的肩膀。
    <</language>><<ggrespect>><<glove 'Zephyr'>>
  <<case 'rescue_failed'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You tie the rope and climb over the side. The current is stronger than you expected. You reach for the sailor, but a wave throws you against the hull. <<if maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations')?.Undead.active>>The crew haul you back. The rope digs into your waist. You feel no pain, but you still cannot fight the current.<<else>>The crew haul you back, the rope biting into your waist as you cough up seawater.<</if>>
        <br><br>
        Another sailor throws a line from the stern. The person in the water catches it. You sit beside the hatch while the crew pull them aboard and push the other ship away with spars.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你系好绳子翻下船舷，水流却比想象中急得多。你朝落水者伸出手，一个浪头将你拍回船身。<<if maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations')?.Undead.active>>船员们将你拉了回去。绳子勒进腰间，你感受不到疼痛，却也没法抵住水流。<<else>>船员们将你拉了回去，绳子勒得腰间生疼。你咳了几口海水。<</if>>
        <br><br>
        另一名水手从船尾抛下绳子，落水者抓住了它。你坐在舱口旁，看着船员们将人拉上来，又用长杆推开那艘船。
    <</language>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
  <<case 'shelter'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You close the hatch and bolt it. Boots pound overhead. You hear shouts, blows and something being dragged across the deck, followed by a splash. You wait in the dark until the noise dies down.
        <br><br>
        "They're gone!" someone calls. You open the hatch. Sailors are pulling a crewmate over the rail, and the unlit ship is fading into the fog. Zephyr stands beside the cargo hold, arms folded, checking the crates with <<his 'Zephyr'>> boot.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你关上舱盖，插好门栓。头顶传来奔跑、喊叫与打斗的声音，有什么东西被拖过甲板，随后落进水里。你在黑暗中等着，直到上面的动静平息。
        <br><br>
        “他们走了！”外面有人喊。你推开舱盖，看见水手们正将同伴拉上船。没有航灯的船退入雾里。泽菲尔抱着双臂站在货舱边，用脚拨着木箱，检查有没有丢东西。
    <</language>><<gstress>>
  <<case 'dawn'>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Morning light reaches the deck. The dead pirate lets go and drops over the rail. Sailors cut the trailing ropes. As the fog clears, the other ship is gone. Zephyr orders the crew to check the cargo and hull before getting any sleep.' '晨光洒上甲板。亡灵海盗松开手，翻下船舷。水手们砍断拖在海里的绳子。雾气散去，那艘船已经不见了。泽菲尔让船员们先检查货物和船身，再去睡觉。'>>
  <<case 'fight_lost'>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Your legs give way and you slump against the rail. Before the corpse can drag you overboard, a spar strikes it in the chest. Two sailors pull you towards the hatch. You hear a splash behind you. When you look back, the other ship is falling astern.' '你双腿一软，倒在栏杆旁。尸体正要将你拖下海，一根长杆打中了它的胸口。两个水手将你拉向舱口。身后传来落水声，等你回头，那艘船已经落在后面。'>>
  <<case 'escaped'>>
    <<lanSwitch 'You wrench free and stumble towards the hatch. The crew close in with spars and belaying pins, knocking the corpse overboard. Zephyr orders them to cut the ropes. The ship picks up speed, and you lean against the bulkhead to catch your breath.' '你挣脱出来，跌跌撞撞地退向舱口。船员们拿着长杆和插销棒围上去，将尸体赶下海。泽菲尔下令砍断绳索。船渐渐加速，你靠着舱壁喘气。'>>
  <<default>>
    <<lanSwitch 'The fighting is over. You did not see how it ended.' '打斗声已经平息，你没看到这场袭击如何结束。'>>
<</switch>><br><br>
<<if maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations')?.Undead.active and _shipRaid.outcome isnot 'shelter'>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You check yourself for injuries. Without pain, it is hard to tell where you were hit. A sailor reaches to steady you, then pulls back at the touch of your cold hand.' '你低头检查身上的伤。没有痛觉，你很难察觉自己挨了几下。一个水手伸手想扶你，碰到冰冷的手掌后，又缩了回去。'>><br><br>
<</if>>
<</if>>
<<if _shipRaid.talked>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "They stole from me at Coldmoon Harbour, too," Zephyr says, kicking a broken crate into place. "Drowned thieves. Don't ask me where their curse came from."
      <<if $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage is 2>>"Remember that chest ye promised to find. Red cord round the lid."
      <<elseif $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage is 3>>"Still got me chest? Bring it over once we've cleared this mess."<</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      “先前在寒月港湾抢我货的也是他们，”泽菲尔说着，将破木箱踢回原位。“淹死了还改不了偷抢。至于什么诅咒，我可不知道。”
      <<if $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage is 2>>“记得答应替我找的箱子，箱盖上扎着红绳。”
      <<elseif $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage is 3>>“箱子还在你手里吧？收拾完这里就送过来。”<</if>>
  <</language>><br><br>
<<elseif !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$frozenValues and !$possessed>>
  <<icon 'coldmoon-harbour/ghost-ship.png'>><<lanLink ["Ask Zephyr about the ship (0:05)", '问泽菲尔那艘船的事 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Pirate Raid Finish'>>
    <<if $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.stage is 'resolved' and !$MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.talked and $location is 'pirate_ship' and !$combat and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$frozenValues and !$possessed and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
      <<pass 5>>
      <<if $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.stage is 'resolved' and !$MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.talked and $passage is 'Deadwood Pirate Raid Finish' and $location is 'pirate_ship'
        and !$combat and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$frozenValues and !$possessed and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
        <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.talked to true, $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.needsEffects to true, $MoreTransformations.harbour.ship to true>>
        <<psyche-rest 0 100>>
      <</if>>
    <</if>>
  <</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>
<<if _shipRaid.rested>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You sit against the bulkhead, out of the crew\'s way. After a few minutes, your breathing settles and you get to your feet.' '你靠着舱壁坐下，避开来往的船员。过了几分钟，你缓过气来，重新站起身。'>><br><br>
<<elseif !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$frozenValues and !$possessed>>
  <<relaxicon>><<lanLink ['Rest by the hatch (0:05)', '在舱口缓一缓 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Pirate Raid Finish'>>
    <<if $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.stage is 'resolved' and !$MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.rested and $location is 'pirate_ship' and !$combat and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$frozenValues and !$possessed and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
      <<pass 5>>
      <<if $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.stage is 'resolved' and !$MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.rested and $passage is 'Deadwood Pirate Raid Finish' and $location is 'pirate_ship'
        and !$combat and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$frozenValues and !$possessed and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
        <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.rested to true, $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.needsEffects to true>>
        <<stress -4>><<tiredness -3>><<psyche-rest 0 200>>
      <</if>>
    <</if>>
  <</lanLink>><<lstress>><<ltiredness>><<if maplebirch.get('Psyche')?.active>><<if $Psyche.mood lt 0>><<llfascination>><<elseif $Psyche.mood gt 0>><<lldread>><</if>><</if>><br>
<</if>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the deck', '返回甲板'] 'Pirate Deck'>>
  <<if $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.stage is 'resolved' and !$combat and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$frozenValues and !$possessed and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
    <<if ['fight_won', 'ropes', 'rescue'].includes($MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.outcome) and $location is 'pirate_ship' and !$eventforced>><<earnFeat 'Deadwood Ghost Ship'>><</if>>
    <<if ['ropes', 'ropes_failed', 'rescue', 'rescue_failed', 'shelter'].includes($MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.outcome)>><<endevent>><</if>>
    <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.stage to '', $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.outcome to '', $MoreTransformations.harbour.raid.needsEffects to false, $eventskip to 1>>
  <</if>>
<</lanLink>><br>
